{% comment %}
@description: Trang phan loai bai viet (danh muc hoac chu de).
@required_substrings: {% layout "layout" %}, {% block content %}, {% endblock %}, category.name, posts, category.customFields, categoryPath
@required_ids:
@notes: Dung chung cho /danh-muc/:slug va /chu-de/:slug. category co name/excerpt/body/children[]/customFields. categoryPath la URL hien tai dung cho phan trang; backHref/backLabel va childPathPrefix co the duoc truyen theo ngu canh. PHAI giu {% render "custom-fields", fields: category.customFields %}. posts[] chi co slug/title/excerpt/coverImage/publishedAt (KHONG co url/image/tags) - link bai viet PHAI dung {{ postUrlPrefix }}/{{ post.slug }} (bien global tu themeRenderer.ts, KHONG hardcode "/blog/" vi site co the tuy chinh postSlugPrefix), anh bia PHAI dung post.coverImage (khong phai post.image).
{% endcomment %}

